    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaccda14d181e1df",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 是一个拥有 30B 参数的稠密模型，由以下部分组成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "615ec5bbe87b8271",
      "translationZh": "用于视觉的 2B ViT 风格编码器（Perception Encoder）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f593f7712c215fdb",
      "translationZh": "28B 参数的文本解码器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e196ebdbaaf7df7",
      "translationZh": "除了主 VLM 外，还有一个基于 DFlash 实现的推测解码草稿生成器。该模块可选用，能够以一定的内存开销为代价，大幅提升生成速度。我们发现，这个草稿生成器尤其适合代码编写等结构化内容生成任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f75c70d0d0fb53c4",
      "translationZh": "文本解码器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c0a2329d0fdf61a",
      "translationZh": "该语言模型采用以下架构组件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdd179a498a164ab",
      "translationZh": "混合注意力：交替使用三个采用旋转位置嵌入的滑动窗口层（窗口大小为 2,048 个 token），随后是第四个采用全注意力和 NoPE（无位置嵌入）的层。因此，其模式为 (SWA, SWA, SWA, Full)，重复 13 次，共计 52 层。这使模型能够借助 RoPE 保留相对顺序和距离信息，并借助 NoPE 在全局范围内保留信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f596fbcc404a1cbc",
      "translationZh": "门控分组查询注意力：每个键值头由 16 个查询头共享，从而将 KV-cache 的内存占用降至原来的 1/16，并使生成更快、成本更低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b056c2d7a33d408b",
      "translationZh": "带有额外查询缩放的 Q-K 归一化：在计算注意力之前，Muse Glimmer 对每个查询头和键头应用 RMS 归一化，以保持注意力 logits 稳定。随后，将查询乘以一个缩放因子，以设定归一化后的目标 logit 尺度。额外的查询缩放在 softmax 层面上起到类似逆温度的作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8eda7efb80ef7756",
      "translationZh": "感知编码器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ade5859f85deea3b",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 使用一个图像编码器同时处理图像和视频。与其他 VLM 中使用的相对较小的视觉编码器不同，这是一个规模较大的 2B 类 ViT 模型，按照 Perception Encoder 架构设计。Perception Encoder 此前由 Meta 推出，作为各种下游空间任务和多模态任务的骨干网络。该编码器将图像切分为形状为 2 帧 x 3 通道 x 14 x 14 的图像块，并将它们送入线性层进行投影。随后，将从学习得到的位置表中插值得到的绝对位置嵌入加到这些嵌入上。接着，这些嵌入被送入由 50 层和 GELU MLP 组成的视觉塔。与语言模型类似，其注意力模式由三个窗口注意力层后接一个全注意力层组成。在注意力层内部，对查询和键应用 2D RoPE。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eff18d0512a4df66",
      "translationZh": "在 transformer 之后，pixel shuffle 将相邻空间 token 按 2x2 分组拼接，在不丢弃其通道的情况下，将图像 token 的数量降至原来的 1/4。随后，将合并后的特征投影到文本解码器的共享嵌入空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "512294f6dbdbdca5",
      "translationZh": "视频逐帧经过同一个编码器，其中每一帧都被转换为图像块（形状为 [批次, 时间分组, 网格高度, 网格宽度, 2 帧, 3 通道, 14, 14]）。处理器以每秒 2 帧为目标，并将片段限制为在整个视频中均匀采样的最多 96 帧。处理器创建带时间戳的视频占位符，将文本与帧交错排列，例如“Time: 0.0s <|video|> x N”，其中最终的视频嵌入会在最后一个投影层之前被替换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "033549df9ef8f5e6",
      "translationZh": "变换器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6b0fc8fdeb168b0",
      "translationZh": "将 transformers 升级到最新版本，以便使用 Muse Glimmer。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff3f0fc7d641c52",
      "translationZh": "transformers 在 Muse Glimmer 发布首日就提供了支持，既支持主模型，也支持推测解码的草拟模型。你可以使用 AutoModelForMultimodalLM 和 AutoProcessor 类来加载模型和处理器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56d97d0dc18d2cae",
      "translationZh": "同一段代码无需修改即可在 NVIDIA (CUDA)、AMD (ROCm) 和 Intel (XPU) GPU 上运行，device_map=\"auto\" 会将模型放置在可用的加速器上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1edf721e2cf6dab2",
      "translationZh": "纯文本推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e115ba84fdad9092",
      "translationZh": "加载模型后，你可以按如下方式使用它进行纯文本推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ada66218a3b6d4a",
      "translationZh": "使用图像和文本提示模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17633a2480ccae52",
      "translationZh": "我们需要 torchvision 才能使用图像和文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18e4b83139a302b7",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 接受图像作为输入，如此处所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cd7e60ffd7d83dc",
      "translationZh": "视频推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaff30eaff64e644",
      "translationZh": "要处理视频，我们建议在环境中安装 torchcodec。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed32c37061283a8b",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 可以回答有关无音频视频的复杂问题。你可以按如下方式进行视频推理，这里展示的是来自 VideoMME2 的一个示例，它是最受欢迎的视频问答基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "85b7c64ec02bb28a",
      "translationZh": "多模态工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e34707584964dd9c",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 可以进行多模态工具调用，下面介绍如何操作。在下面的示例中，我们要求模型根据图像中的城市调用天气工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "40550eed966fdeb9",
      "translationZh": "目标检测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0162",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3a810fcf360077e",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 Muse Glimmer 按如下方式对图像进行开放式目标检测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0163",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b19b4c8380c78652",
      "translationZh": "这里有一个用于执行目标检测的端到端脚本：GitHub Gist",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0165",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38a7bc7f88f6e62b",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 从发布首日起就支持 llama.cpp。Meta 已在此仓库中分发了经过校准的量化版本，Unsloth 也正在发布经过优化的量化版本。同时也支持 DFlash 推测解码。你可以使用预构建的 llama 二进制程序启动 llama 服务器或 CLI。要安装 llama.cpp，请运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0166",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc35c88970f43e7d",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以按如下方式启动服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0167",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa31a5e98e0ff211",
      "translationZh": "服务器启动后，你可以访问 localhost:8080，通过内置的 WebUI 进行聊天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0168",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3344982c5a4943e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以按如下方式向服务器发送查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0169",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9786a8b8f571bf79",
      "translationZh": "你还可以将 llama 服务器与 Pi 等编程智能体配合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0170",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "abae7cbfa34957df",
      "translationZh": "推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0171",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2bbd9eba7e3d588",
      "translationZh": "DFlash 使用轻量级的块扩散草稿模型，在解码阶段提供额外加速，同时保持输出相同。Transformers 和 llama.cpp 在 Muse Glimmer 发布首日即提供对其 DFlash 草稿模型的支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "670ee4243f291b69",
      "translationZh": "下面可以看到推测解码如何在实际使用场景中加速生成。视频展示了 llama.cpp webui，左侧启用 DFlash，右侧采用常规生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0173",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5cca15699942b83a",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers 进行推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f6e7c7ebc1a6e0",
      "translationZh": "你可以按如下方式加载草稿模型和主模型，然后像使用基础模型一样进行推理，只需额外添加一个参数（将在接下来的代码片段中展示）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0175",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82eb1bc0fcd0a490",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 进行推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0176",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6b5ba5d099837a6",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用以下命令启动 llama server。--spec-draft-n-max 参数控制 DFlash 在每个推测解码步骤中提出多少个未来 token。Muse Glimmer 的 DFlash 模型训练时采用的块大小为 16，即一个锚定 token 加上 15 个提议 token，因此任何大于 15 的值都会被限制为 15。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0177",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d590538b8b4c0b7d",
      "translationZh": "你也可以按如下方式使用 llama cli，并搭配推测解码草稿模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0178",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be2ee939ae5d67c7",
      "translationZh": "推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0179",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "673651eac07b7213",
      "translationZh": "要进行托管式、自动扩缩容的部署，请打开 Muse Glimmer 30B Inference Endpoints 预设。模型已选定：选择组织、云提供商、区域、兼容的 GPU 实例、身份验证和自动扩缩容设置，然后查看每小时价格并点击 Create Endpoint。待状态变为 Running 后，你就可以在 Playground 中测试它，并从 Overview 中复制端点 URL 和模型名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cd809d641e5a8bb",
      "translationZh": "部署的模型提供与 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions API。将你的 Hugging Face 令牌保存在环境变量中，将 HF_ENDPOINT_URL 设置为 Overview 中显示的 URL，但不包含 /v1，并将 HF_ENDPOINT_MODEL 设置为端点的模型名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "184a2b7b192e72d3",
      "translationZh": "有关配置、自动扩缩容、安全、日志和监控的信息，请参阅 Inference Endpoints 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0182",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "16cdc6f9ee13ba7c",
      "translationZh": "支持采用 transformers 后端的 Muse Glimmer vLLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef4e1554fe097ba5",
      "translationZh": "在本次发布中，我们提供了对采用 transformers 后端的 vLLM 的支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0184",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7beb9c9d348160ce",
      "translationZh": "使用 TRL 进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "553deec90fc85778",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 TRL，通过从 SFT 到 Async GRPO 的各种方法来微调 Muse Glimmer。我们使用 bf16，在每块配备 80GB 显存的 Hopper 级 GPU 上进行了两项实验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0186",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba3c74c1a18f50a1",
      "translationZh": "工作负载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "400da9b6d5dd6ee6",
      "translationZh": "实际最低配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0188",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51b6059757b82af9",
      "translationZh": "推理 / 评估，BF16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0190",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9976b559bd56a2d9",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 监督微调，BF16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0191",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9aad7966f15373ad",
      "translationZh": "1×80 GB H100，微批次大小为 1 + 检查点机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0192",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a81909e3fb9f227",
      "translationZh": "全参数监督微调，BF16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2594f463c6884e0d",
      "translationZh": "8×80 GB H100，使用 FSDP/ZeRO-3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac5ca666b262c59a",
      "translationZh": "LoRA GRPO，使用 Transformers 生成采样轨迹",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84b248521c946f6c",
      "translationZh": "1×80 GB H100，但速度慢、资源紧张",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0196",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6754f4bb19e1baa5",
      "translationZh": "LoRA GRPO，使用独立的 vLLM rollout 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d969603913911696",
      "translationZh": "8×H100：4 张用于 rollout + 4 张用于训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0198",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec8f887fe20eccfb",
      "translationZh": "全参数微调 GRPO",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0199",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8ab94b480dca368",
      "translationZh": "8 张 GPU 通常不够",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0200",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d66f6bb33461d0db",
      "translationZh": "作为本次发布的一部分，我们提供了一个示例，用于在 MolmoWeb 数据集的一个小型子集上微调 Muse Glimmer。该示例展示了如何让模型生成结构化输出，以及如何使用图像进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0201",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08d6ffe621d51651",
      "translationZh": "我们还尝试了使用 AsyncGRPO 示例在 OpenCode 上运行该模型。模型展现出强大的编程能力，因此我们鼓励你尝试使用 OpenEnv 和 TRL 中的编程环境进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0202",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f61ec10d1385dcc0",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0203",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02bfc87b486a6fd2",
      "translationZh": "下面是一些试用 Muse Glimmer 的有趣方式。我们认为，这个模型最酷的地方在于，它是一个规模适合本地运行、能够编写代码的个人助手。这意味着你可以让它做这些事：量化自身、在 Hub 上查找量化权重、将自身部署到推理端点，甚至针对特定硬件优化自身！本地派，加油 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0204",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "143323f291369c1b",
      "translationZh": "将 OpenClaw 连接到 Muse Glimmer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0205",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32eeca7fe2a5fbf6",
      "translationZh": "假设 Inference Endpoint 提供与 OpenAI 兼容的 /v1 API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0206",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a32f4c8d75d700c5",
      "translationZh": "在 OpenClaw 网关环境中设置 HF_TOKEN，然后将以下内容添加到 ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0207",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c08cdc1817aaa8e8",
      "translationZh": "OpenClaw 配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0208",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e37e433bfa3ec91",
      "translationZh": "重启 OpenClaw：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0209",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b679af8965d00c7",
      "translationZh": "在新会话中进行验证：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0210",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d250622b72c6dd59",
      "translationZh": "如果端点的 /v1/models 响应返回的模型 ID 与此不同，请使用其返回的准确模型 ID。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0211",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "29cff04df6783755",
      "translationZh": "嘿，Muse Glimmer，把自己量化一下",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0212",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f52b1f0a3666379a",
      "translationZh": "如果我们将 Muse Glimmer 接入 Hugging Face MCP，并更新它的 AGENTS.md，就能让它在 Hub 上找到自己的量化版本并在本地运行。如果你想处理一些私密的事情，或者只是想降低成本，这会很方便。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0213",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d85728282d300d1",
      "translationZh": "如果你再做一次，Muse Glimmer 就会找到缓存的权重并切换到它们，所以不妨添加一个方便的命令，比如 /spawn。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0214",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f18ed552fc77db25",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 会检查机器和 Hub，选择或创建一个 Q4_K_M GGUF，启动 llama-server，并验证模型发现和聊天补全。最终得到的是一个体积更小的本地版本，通过兼容 OpenAI 的 API 提供服务。以下是我们添加到 AGENTS.md 的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0216",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8060268ed10c96f",
      "translationZh": "将这段内容添加到 AGENTS.md 后，openclaw 或 hermes 就能解决剩下的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0217",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aed6afa3846d482f",
      "translationZh": "本地量化提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0218",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f2aeb2abaeb9b930",
      "translationZh": "嘿，Muse Glimmer，把自己部署起来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0219",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "989de0a2fa9555d4",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 也能处理相反的情况。让我们让 Glimmer 将自己部署到 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 上。如果你想借助一些尖端硬件来提速，这会很有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0220",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6f9b0f05947b1c0",
      "translationZh": "注意：你也可以直接将 Muse Glimmer 部署到 Inference Endpoints，并连接你的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0221",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d49928fcc7517969",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 固定模型修订版本，将其部署到受保护的 Hugging Face Inference Endpoint，并验证健康状态、模型发现和聊天补全功能。随后，它连接 Claw 智能体，同时保留密钥和回滚能力。以下是我们添加到 AGENTS.md 的提示词。Muse glimmer 还需要 Hugging Face MCP 和/或 Hugging Face CLI 及 Skills。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0222",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8223819780743d4f",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoint 部署提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0223",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9bdb689d449abdce",
      "translationZh": "嘿，Muse Glimmer，优化你自己",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0224",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26da1e56686a3544",
      "translationZh": "最后，让我们让 Muse Glimmer 做一点轻量的 RSI。我们可以指示智能体针对特定硬件优化它自己的推理引擎，在这里是 Nvidia H100。为此，智能体需要使用另一个推理引擎，例如上文的 Inference Endpoints。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0225",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340462f48bd163cc",
      "translationZh": "Muse Glimmer 对它自己的单 H100 服务栈进行基准测试，在保持工作负载不变的情况下，每次测试一项可撤销的改动。它只保留通过正确性验证的性能提升，最终得到速度最快且可复现的配置。以下是我们添加到 AGENTS.md 的提示词。Muse glimmer 需要 Hugging Face MCP、Hugging Face CLI 和 Skills。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0226",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3afb6a808238a79c",
      "translationZh": "自我优化提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0228",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "947c25c852e21e12",
      "translationZh": "嘿，Muse Glimmer，研究一下 Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0229",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39de29da0bdb6c67",
      "translationZh": "试试将 Muse Glimmer 用作 Hugging Face 研究智能体。这个 Gradio Space 通过私有 Hugging Face Inference Endpoint 的 OpenAI 兼容 API，将每个模型请求发送到该端点。它还连接到官方 Hugging Face MCP 服务器，为智能体提供只读工具，以搜索和查看 Hub 上的仓库、模型、数据集、Spaces、文档和论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0230",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3bcbb261c4b68be",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0231",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9232372a32731b78",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴欢迎 Muse Glimmer 加入 Hugging Face Hub。今天就用你的本地编程环境试试 Muse Glimmer 吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
